 "scope": "For each of the twelve Amsas (the Navamsha sign of the Moon's pada) the effect of the dasha of each of the nine signs of its sequence, in the book's order (a sign that comes twice in a sequence has two entries). The book gives the nine-sign sequences of the Savya chakra only; the signs listed here are the same as kalachakraBphs.js's Savya sequences, so the entry for a dasha is found by its place in the sequence.",
